Package: openchroma
Version: 1.0.7
Architecture: all
Maintainer: TJ Travis <tljtravis@gmail.com>
Depends: python3, python3-pyqt6, python3-evdev, python3-dbus, xdotool, openrazer-meta
Description: Universal Razer peripheral management utility for Linux
 OpenChroma provides per-profile key remapping, dynamic window auto-profile
 switching, sensitivity staging, and Chroma RGB lighting control for Razer
 peripherals across both Wayland and X11 desktop environments.
